  "campaign": "coop",
  "order": 1,
  "title": "Two Fronts",
  "briefing": "The Crucible Host is massing in the southern hollows of Crater Basin and will come north up both rims at once. Westwatch holds the western rim, Eastwatch the eastern. Each of you has one road to keep shut; when a flank buckles, the other has to send help. Outlast the offensive, then burn both staging camps in the south.",
