  "spawnCommanders": true,
  "messages": [
    "Oversight online. Two commands, two roads. Westwatch: the western rim is yours. Eastwatch: the east. First contact in about three minutes.",
    "Get extractors on the rim deposits and a factory up early. Turrets on the road buy time; an army wins it.",
    "A Commander is down! The surviving command holds both roads now.",
    "Contact, west road! Host scouts and bots climbing the rim.",
    "East road now. Eastwatch, they're testing you.",
    "Anvils on the west road.",
    "And the east. Both flanks at once.",
    "Heavy push west, mortars behind the tanks.",
    "Heavy push east. Westwatch, can you spare anything?",
    "Artillery with the west column. Kill the guns.",
    "Gunships over the basin, heading between your bases. Anti-air!",
    "Last of the offensive: heavies on both roads. Hold!",
    "The offensive is broken. Now finish it: both staging camps in the south, west and east.",
    "Western camp burning.",
    "Eastern camp burning.",
    "The Host is throwing its reserve at the gap between your bases.",
    "Both camps erased. Crater Basin is ours. Good work, both of you."
  ],
